<Document>
  <name><![CDATA[FRS Query Output of USEPA Geospatial Data of Regulated Facilities or Cleanup Locations]]></name>
  <open>0</open><visibility>0</visibility>
  <description><![CDATA[This KML file was produced by the US Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) on 14-NOV-26 and contains data specifying the
locations of EPA regulated facilities or cleanups that are being provided by EPA for use by commercial mapping services
and others with an interest in using this information. Updates to this file are produced on a regular basis by EPA
and those updates as well as documentation describing the contents of the file can be found at URL:http://www.epa.gov/enviro.  This file is based on a database query of FRS facilities with the following selection criteria: <BR> <b>NAIC Code: </b>112120<br>Set 1 of Facilities/Sites
]]></description>
