      <b><font face="Times New Roman" color="SteelBlue" effect="shadow" size="+2">$[name]</font></b>
      <br/><br/>
      $[description]
      <br/><br/>
      Disclaimer: Site locations are provided for informational purposes. EPA does not guarantee the accuracy or completeness of the data.
      EPA is not responsible for errors or omissions related to the use of the Google Earth mapping program.</font>
      <br/><br/>
